        {"source": "spec", "quote": "Inferred: the bias/fail-safe purpose of the A/B line pull resistors (R6, R8, R15) on the MAX3485."}
      ],
      "impact": "In serial-servo mode the MAX3485 receiver output will be held low when the bus is idle, and the driver differential will not produce the expected idle-high UART state. RXD2 would appear to be in a break/low state, preventing reliable half-duplex serial communication with the servos.",
